# Frontend

Do not start the main frontend until the onchain credit loop works (Phase 11).

Feel: serious financial terminal, not a typical DeFi dashboard.

Five screens only for MVP: Market, Credit Profile, Credit Account, Trade, Risk Center.

Trade review must surface contract checks, then execute onchain. Show onchain rejection reasons. Never hide a revert behind a friendly client-only block.

Risk Center must show multiplier math and policy diffs (e.g. $50K → $36K, 5x → 3.5x).

Stack: Next.js, React, TypeScript, Tailwind, wagmi, viem, ECharts.
